/* Reuses parts of the :: Sea Tentacles event and the :: Beach Party event */
:: Fishing Beach Tentacles
<<effects>>
You hear something slithering across the sand beneath you. Before you can step away, a <<print ["slimy", "sticky", "thick", "throbbing", "slick", "moist", "quivering", "sodden", "shivering", "shuddering", "narrow", "undulating", "thin", "bulbous", "bumpy"].random()>> tentacle coils around your ankle, and yanks you off your feet and towards the water.
<br><br>

<<if $angel gte 4 and $angelBanish gte 1>>
	<<link [[Banish the tentacle|Fishing Beach Tentacles Banish]]>><<angelBanishUse>><</link>><<angelBanishNote>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Try to pull away|Fishing Beach Tentacles Escape]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 600 1200>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacles Banish
<<effects>>
You focus your mind on the tentacle wrapping around your leg, then make an intricate gesture with your hand. <span class="green">The tentacle shimmers and recoils violently,</span> releasing you and slipping back into the water.
<br>
<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
	You get to your feet, breathing hard, and look back at the campfire. The teenagers either didn't notice or are pretending that they didn't.<<stress 7>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	You get to your feet, breathing hard.<<stress 7>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacles Escape
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng gte 50>>
		<span class="green">You twist your leg free</span> and stumble to your feet, but the tentacle thrashes as it retreats, sending cold water crashing over you before disappearing into the surf. You stand there shaking, soaked through.<<stress 5>><<gstress>><<wetAll>>
		<br><br>

		<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
			<<generatey1>><<person1>>
			As you catch your breath, you hear footsteps crunching across the sand toward you from the direction of the campfire. When you look up, you see a <<person>> jogging towards you.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Wait|Fishing Beach Tentacles Escape Wet Wait]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Run|Fishing Beach Tentacles Escape Wet Run]]>><<athleticsdifficulty 200 600>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">You twist your leg free</span> and stumble to your feet and away from the water's edge. You stand up and catch your breath as waves crash in the surf before you.<<stress 5>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The tentacle yanks hard, <span class="red">you're pulled backward towards the water,</span> your fingers digging into the sand and unable to gain purchase.
	<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
		<<if $rng gte 20>>
			The teenagers by the fire fall silent, watching in shock. <<generatey1>><<person1>>One of them jumps up and runs toward you. "Hold on!" <<He>> shouts, splashing into the water.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			The teenagers by the fire fall silent, watching you get dragged away. The last thing you see before the water closes around you is their faces, frozen in horror.<<stress 7>><<gstress>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		The last thing you see before the water closes over you is the <<if Time.isBloodMoon()>>red <</if>>light of the moon reflecting on the wet sand.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt
<<effects>>
<<wetAll>>
<<if $rng gte 85>>
	The <<person>> reaches for you, but you're already slipping beneath the surface. <<His>> hand misses yours, and the last thing you see before the ocean swallows you is the look of horror and helplessness on <<his>> face.<<stress 7>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<endevent>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> wades deeper, reaching for your outstretched hand. <<His>> fingers brush yours, and suddenly <<he>> is pulling with all <<his>> strength. You get your feet under you, and together you stumble away from the water and you're pulled out of the grasp of whatever was grabbing you.<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt 2]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt 2
<<effects>>
You collapse on the sand, gasping and shaking.
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
