	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> takes a step back, still catching <<his>> breath, then glances at your <<lewdness>> and quickly looks away, cheeks flushing. "So, uh." <<He>> glances back at the campfire, then at you. "You're really..." <<He>> trails off. From the campfire, <<his>> friends have gone very quiet, then one of them shouts something, followed by laughter from the group. You can see the <<personsimple>>'s face turning bright red, even in the dark.
	<br><br>

	"We have a spare towel at the campfire" <<he>> stammers. "If you want, I can grab it."
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
